end id=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1911_component_2475\">Text Edge Style</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2571\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1911_component_2475\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2572-None\" value=\"none\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2572-None\">None</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2573-Raised\" value=\"raised\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2573-Raised\">Raised</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2574-Depressed\" value=\"depressed\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2574-Depressed\">Depressed</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2575-Uniform\" value=\"uniform\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2575-Uniform\">Uniform</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2576-Dropshadow\" value=\"dropshadow\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2576-Dropshadow\">Drop shadow</option></select></fieldset><fieldset class=\"vjs-font-family vjs-track-setting\"><legend id=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1911_component_2475\">Font Family</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2586\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1911_component_2475\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2587-ProportionalSansSerif\" value=\"proportionalSansSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2587-ProportionalSansSerif\">Proportional Sans-Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2588-MonospaceSansSerif\" value=\"monospaceSansSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2588-MonospaceSansSerif\">Monospace Sans-Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2589-ProportionalSerif\" value=\"proportionalSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2589-ProportionalSerif\">Proportional Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2590-MonospaceSerif\" value=\"monospaceSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2590-MonospaceSerif\">Monospace Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2591-Casual\" value=\"casual\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2591-Casual\">Casual</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2592-Script\" value=\"script\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2592-Script\">Script</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2593-SmallCaps\" value=\"small-caps\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1911_component_2475 vjs-track-option-2593-SmallCaps\">Small Caps</option></select></fieldset></div><div class=\"vjs-track-settings-controls\"><button class=\"vjs-default-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"restore all settings to the default values\" aria-disabled=\"false\">Reset</button><button class=\"vjs-done-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Done\" aria-disabled=\"false\">Done</button></div></div><button class=\"vjs-close-button vjs-control vjs-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Close Modal Dialog\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"vjs-icon-placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"vjs-control-text\" aria-live=\"polite\">Close Modal Dialog</span></button><p class=\"vjs-control-text\">End of dialog window.</p></div></video-js></div></div></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">SEO 优化的流程我一共分为6个步骤，分别是：</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>关键词研究与分析</li>\n<li>页面内容优化</li>\n<li>技术SEO优化</li>\n<li>分析工具配置</li>\n<li>外链建设策略</li>\n<li>SEO效果监测</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1. 关键词研究与分析</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">关键词收集工具</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div><a href=\"https://semrush.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEMRUSH</a>的Keyword Magic Tool</div>\n<ul>\n<li>使用方法和筛选技巧</li>\n<li>竞争度分析（KD值解读）</li>\n<li>长尾关键词发掘</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><a href=\"https://similarweb.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Similarweb</a>的关键词生成器</div>\n<ul>\n<li>竞品关键词分析</li>\n<li>市场趋势洞察</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google搜索框自动补全</a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>用户搜索意图分析</li>\n<li>相关搜索词收集</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><a href=\"https://ads.google.com/home/tools/keyword-planner/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Ads关键字规划工具</a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>新关键词发现</li>\n<li>搜索量和竞争度分析</li>\n<li>季节性趋势分析</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">KeywordTool.io</a> 搜索扩展关键词</div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io/google\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Keyword Tool</a> Google搜索量分析</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io/youtube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube Keyword Tool</a> YouTube搜索量分析</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io/bing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bing Keyword Tool</a> Bing搜索量分析</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io/app-store\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">App Store Keyword Tool</a> 应用推广优化</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io/google-play\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Play Store Keyword Tool</a> Android应用优化</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io/instagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Instagram Keyword Tool</a> 社交媒体标签</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io/twitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Twitter Keyword Tool</a> 话题标签研究</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io/pinterest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pinterest Keyword Tool</a> 图片内容优化</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://keywordtool.io/tiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TikTok Keyword Tool</a> 短视频内容优化</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://trends.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Trends</a> 搜索趋势分析</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">关键词筛选标准</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>KD值 &lt; 30（可考虑KD &lt; 40的词）</li>\n<li>月搜索量 &gt; 600-800</li>\n<li>商业价值评估</li>\n<li>用户意图匹配度</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">关键词层级规划</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>主关键词确定</li>\n<li>次关键词布局</li>\n<li>长尾关键词分布</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2. 页面内容优化</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">使用Cursor优化内容</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>关键词密度控制（3-5%）</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>内容长度规划（600-800字/页）</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>内容结构优化</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>用户体验提升</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<div>帮我优化首页，主关键词是weather icons，次关键词是weather app icon，主关键词密度控制在3-5%，次关键词密度控制在1-2%，页面中的内容长度控制在600-800字/页，内容结构优化，用户体验提升。</div>\n</blockquote>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img1.webp\" alt=\"Cursor 优化页面内容\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img2.webp\" alt=\"Cursor 优化页面内容\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img3.webp\" alt=\"Cursor 优化页面内容\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img4.webp\" alt=\"Cursor 优化页面内容\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3. 技术SEO优化</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">Meta 信息优化</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>页面 Title 和 Description 最佳实践</li>\n<li>Open Graph (og) 标签配置</li>\n<li>H1-H6 标签层级优化</li>\n<li>结构化数据（Schema.org）实现</li>\n</ul>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img5.webp\" alt=\"Open Graph 标签配置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">性能优化</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://pagespeed.web.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PageSpeed Insights</a> 性能检测和优化\n<ul>\n<li>核心性能指标</li>\n<li>优化建议实施</li>\n<li>移动端性能优化</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img6.webp\" alt=\"PageSpeed Insights 性能检测\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img7.webp\" alt=\"PageSpeed 优化建议\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">爬虫优化</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>robots.txt 配置\n<ul>\n<li>允许/禁止爬虫规则</li>\n<li>重要路径设置</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img8.webp\" alt=\"Robots.txt 配置示例\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>sitemap.xml 管理</div>\n<ul>\n<li>自动生成和更新</li>\n<li>提交到搜索引擎</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>URL规范化</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Canonical URLs设置</li>\n<li>重复内容处理</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>移动端适配</div>\n<ul>\n<li>响应式设计检查</li>\n<li>移动友好度测试</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">4. 分析工具配置</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\"><a href=\"https://analytics.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Analytics 4</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>账号创建和代码部署</li>\n<li>数据收集配置</li>\n<li>转化跟踪设置</li>\n<li>数据分析和优化</li>\n</ul>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img9.webp\" alt=\"Google Analytics 配置步骤1\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img10.webp\" alt=\"Google Analytics 配置步骤2\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img11.webp\" alt=\"Google Analytics 数据收集设置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img12.webp\" alt=\"Google Analytics 转化跟踪\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img13.webp\" alt=\"Google Analytics 指标分析\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img14.webp\" alt=\"Google Analytics 优化建议\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img15.webp\" alt=\"Google Analytics 高级设置\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img16.webp\" alt=\"Google Analytics 数据报告\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img17.webp\" alt=\"Google Analytics 用户行为分析\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\"><a href=\"https://search.google.com/search-console\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Search Console</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>站点验证</li>\n<li>性能监控</li>\n<li>索引状态管理</li>\n<li>问题诊断和修复</li>\n</ul>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img18.webp\" alt=\"Google Search Console 验证\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img19.webp\" alt=\"Google Search Console Sitemap提交\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img20.webp\" alt=\"Google Search Console 索引覆盖\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img21.webp\" alt=\"Google Search Console 搜索分析\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img22.webp\" alt=\"Google Search Console 性能报告\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\"><a href=\"https://clarity.microsoft.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Microsoft Clarity</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>用户行为分析</li>\n<li>热力图追踪</li>\n<li>会话录制</li>\n<li>优化建议实施</li>\n</ul>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img23.webp\" alt=\"Microsoft Clarity 注册配置\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img24.webp\" alt=\"Microsoft Clarity 热力图分析\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img25.webp\" alt=\"Microsoft Clarity 会话录制\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/if8ls06pcd_img26.webp\" alt=\"Microsoft Clarity 用户行为分析\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">5. 外链建设策略</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">高质量外链来源</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>产品目录提交\n<ul>\n<li>初创产品目录网站列表 <a href=\"https://aimaker.dev/directory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://aimaker.dev/directory</a></li>\n<li>用Excel表格统计提交进度，用 <a href=\"https://ahrefs.com/backlink-checker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://ahrefs.com/backlink-checker</a> 检查外链效果</li>\n<li>用 <a href=\"https://www.semrush.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.semrush.com/</a> 分析竞争对手外链情况</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>从行业竞品网站的外链中，找到可以合作的网站\n<ul>\n<li>用 <a href=\"https://ahrefs.com/backlink-checker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://ahrefs.com/backlink-checker</a> 检查外链效果</li>\n<li>用 <a href=\"https://www.semrush.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.semrush.com/</a> 分析竞争对手外链情况</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>社交媒体平台\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://x.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Twitter/X</a> 推广策略</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.